      <title>TheShy最后一把克烈封神 Cube成背景板 iG 3:1淘汰WE挺进四强</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260906/TheShy%E6%9C%80%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%8A%8A%E5%85%8B%E7%83%88%E5%B0%81%E7%A5%9E-Cube%E6%88%90%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E6%9D%BF-iG-31%E6%B7%98%E6%B1%B0WE%E6%8C%BA%E8%BF%9B%E5%9B%9B%E5%BC%BA/</link>
